ontributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"code","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-2v.land"},"source_run_id":"run-b1dd44ba9fcdcb204f5a249a578221bf","started_at":"2026-09-30T18:47:28.431877+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1790789260,"sha":"d67bbb0e174f128225424f5ab9a92c2fc09fa612","subject":"feat(capture): add read-only linkable-task discover scanner with tiered ranker"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"74b7429fdac7e669126320659070f9432482952a2c014611b032be932578dec9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.1/chat.md","size_bytes":3769},"commits":{"digest":"753b8d2251128fe21fedfa9e480744864bb5a117a24fd257d739a26b65202b9e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.1/commits.json","size_bytes":256},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"5ed42c51dab3d6c50b3a8924903454c25622c5d31d05f3a49fe51fa08c390d21","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.1/meta.json","size_bytes":5875},"prompt":{"digest":"2355299801dedb509617806d0eddebd217a3a6755a961001bad16bced590d34c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":184},"state":{"digest":"60bc46ee175172dce2da67d68274f66f924172d8710746303f000ee12dc4a5bc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.1/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.1","local_name":"bob-cli-2v.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-2v","agent_clan_generation":"20260930130030","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-2v.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-2v[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]`:` Task Link Picker for bob capture and Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Typing `:` at the start of any capture item, including any item of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a blank-line-separated batch draft, opens a fast, beautiful fuzzy [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]picker over every open (not done or canceled) task in the vault's [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]area and project notes. Accepting a task replaces the `:` query [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]with the canonical `@route:block-id` link. Tasks without a block ID[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]get one first, from a prefilled suggestion. The link can then be [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]captured as-is or started with `=`, so any task can be linked into [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]today's Pomodoros in a few keystrokes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]task_link_picker.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/task_link_picker.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-2v[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-2v/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault-wide linkable-task discovery and fuzzy ranking[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]discovery[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]discovery: add the read-only `capture_link_tasks` scanner. It collects [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Ready, Blocked, Next, and In Progress tasks from area, project, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inbox notes. It adds groups, the canonical order, ledger annotation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]block-ID suggestions, schedule pull-forward flags, and a deterministic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tiered fuzzy ranker, all with unit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`:` picker-query grammar in capture, capture-parse, and [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]completion fields[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: add one claim predicate for single-token `:` items. Execution [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rejects them with teaching errors T1 and T2. capture-parse reports [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`incomplete` with `needs: [\"task_link\"]`. The completion field [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](`task_link` context) covers the sigil. Also update help text and add a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]claim-equivalence test.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]CaptureCore task-link picker index, source, and decoding[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_core: in bob-mac-capture's CaptureCore, decode the new candidate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fields and add the `taskLink` picker source and need. Add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`TaskLinkPickerIndex` with grouped and fuzzy-filtered presentations, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows keyed by route and ref, and a `:`-aware FuzzyQuery. Cover it with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unit tests and verify on macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`task_link` completion candidates, round-trip tests, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]complete[dim] · [dim][/dim]after discovery, grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]complete: wire discovery into the `task_link` context of `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-complete`, with a pinned JSON schema, human rows, and help. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Prove accept-then-capture round trips (including capture-task-id for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tasks without an ID), check real-vault latency, and document the feature[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in docs/capture.md and README.md.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture task-link picker panel, ID prompt, and keys[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after complete, mac_core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_panel: route the `task_link` context into the picker card. Accept [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inserts `@route:id`, Shift-Return inserts it with `=`, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Command-Return inserts it and captures. Tasks without an ID open a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prefilled Add block ID prompt that assigns the ID and splices the link, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and Escape returns to the picker. Also update the views, README, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]real-bob fixtures, and tests, and get macOS CI green.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-2v","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-2v.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-c51baad5fbb906d74cf0824610ee7124","started_at":"2026-09-30T17:00:41.953902+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.2","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.3","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.4","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.5","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2v.land"]}
